          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Daily, weekly, monthly, and yearly billing flexibility on every plan</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 99.9% uptime SLA documented in the homepage hero copy</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Predictable USD pricing — no FX risk for non-USD buyers (unlike Vultr's regional price tiers)</li>
