          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU instance tier advertised on the public VPS pricing page</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ VDS-only product line — no KVM vs OpenVZ vs Windows split</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No published affiliate program detected — uses RackNerd fallback for monetization</li>
